{"id":104,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":" وَيْلٌ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍ لُّمَزَةٍ","transliteration":"Waylul-likulli humazatil-lumazat","translation":"Woe to every backbiter, slanderer"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Alladhī jamaʿa mālaw-waʿaddadah","translation":"who amasses wealth ˹greedily˺ and counts it ˹repeatedly˺"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ","transliteration":"Yaḥsabu anna mālahu akhladah","translation":"thinking that their wealth will make them immortal"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","transliteration":"Kallā layunbadhanna fī l-ḥuṭamat","translation":"Not at all! Such a person will certainly be tossed into the Crusher"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā l-ḥuṭamat","translation":"And what will make you realize what the Crusher is"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","transliteration":"Nāru l-lahi l-mūqadat","translation":"˹It is˺ Allah’s kindled Fire"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","transliteration":"Allatī taṭṭaliʿu ʿalā l-afidat","translation":"which rages over the hearts"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌ","transliteration":"Innahā ʿalayhim mu'ṣadat","translation":"It will be sealed over them"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"فِى عَمَدٍ مُّمَدَّدَةٍۭ","transliteration":"Fī ʿamadim-mumaddadat","translation":"˹tightly secured˺ with long braces"}]}